    Integrate obsolete unsafe-hold gate removal onto Act 19 delivery
    
    Merge founder/remove-stale-hold-gates-20261105 (0fb0dde) into the exact
    Act 19 candidate 9392732. The two changesets touch the same appointment
    recovery path: the Act 19 work adds stale-hold archiving on a threshold
    reset, while 0fb0dde removes the per-seat unsafe-hold dispatch vetoes.
    Combined, an office that threshold-resets is no longer blocked forever and
    the old hold is archived as evidence.
    
    Conflict resolution is limited to tests/appointment-recovery-integration-smoke.sh:
    both sides added a different file to the mocked town copy list, so the merge
    keeps the union (handoff-queue.sh plus AGENT-REPORTING-POLICY.md). No test
    assertion was dropped.
    
    Full suite on this exact tree passes except the pre-existing protected
    ballot-integrity check (records/ballots/executive-innovation-office-act.tsv),
    which is a separately reported Parliament/Clerk matter. Not merged, not
    pushed, not deployed.

